    "bookid": 33,
    "chapterId": 125,
    "fileId": 5821,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Extraskeletal myxoid chondrosarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Rhabdoid cells with eccentric eosinophilic cytoplasm and perinuclear hyaline globules are seen in some extraskeletal myxoid chondrosarcomas. These cells are frequently negative for SMARCB1 (INI1) by immunohistochemistry.",
    "source": "Andrew E. Horvai",
